# AWS Bedrock Configuration
# Claude Sonnet 4.6: MODEL_ID는 베이스 ID(anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6). 서울 등 APAC 소스 리전은 global.* profile (AWS 문서).
# AWS_BEDROCK_REGION=ap-northeast-2
# MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6
# 또는 명시: AWS_BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6
# US: AWS_BEDROCK_REGION=us-west-2 , AWS_BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6
# EU: AWS_BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=eu.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6
AWS_BEDROCK_REGION=ap-northeast-2
MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6

# AI Prompt Template
# {main_data}와 {top10_data} 플레이스홀더를 사용하여 동적으로 데이터를 삽입합니다.
AI_PROMPT_TEMPLATE=You are a data analyst for a travel agency. Analyze the following weekly traffic data and provide an executive summary.

Data Context:
- The data covers weekly UV (Unique Visitors) for a travel platform.
- "Co-Brand" refers to partner sites.
- Compare current week vs previous week.

Data Snippets:

[Main Data (Overview & Categories)]
{main_data}

[Top 10 Lists (Brand Mall & Affiliate)]
{top10_data}

Task:
Generate 4 key insights (Executive Summary) in Korean.
Format the output as a JSON array of objects with "title" and "content" keys.

Example Format:
[
    {{ "title": "Insight Title 1", "content": "Detailed explanation..." }},
    {{ "title": "Insight Title 2", "content": "Detailed explanation..." }}
]

Focus on:
1. Overall traffic trend (Growth/Decline).
2. Notable category performance (e.g., Flight vs Hotel).
3. Device share or specific channel performance if visible.
4. Co-brand partner performance.

Output ONLY the JSON array.

# Anthropic API Configuration
ANTHROPIC_VERSION=bedrock-2023-05-31
MAX_TOKENS=1000
